target.value:
-112 countries with at least one operational multisectoral national policy/strategy/action plan that integrates several noncommunicable diseases and shared risk factors;
-133 countries which have set time-bound national noncommunicable disease targets and indicators based on WHO guidance;
-83 countries with at least one operational national multisectoral commission, agency or mechanism for coordinated prevention and control of noncommunicable diseases.

actual.value:
